#. module: website_event_track_gantt
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_track_gantt
msgid ""
"This module helps analyzing and organizing event tracks.\n"
"For that purpose it adds a gantt view on event tracks."
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນນີ້ຊ່ວຍວິເຄາະ ແລະ ຈັດລະບຽບຫົວຂໍ້ບັນຍາຍຂອງງານ.\n"
"ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງນັ້ນ ມັນຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມມຸມມອງ Gantt ສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ບັນຍາຍ."

#. module: website_event_track_gantt
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:website_event_track_gantt.field_event_event__track_gantt_initial_date
